      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "PATIENT INFORMATION\r\n\r\nPatient: Maria Ramirez || case no. 253998867\r\n\r\nDemographics:
    40 year old woman of Mexican decent. \r\n\r\nCondition: Found with major injuries
    from a workplace accident, however the main affliction discovered was Advanced
    Pulmonary Tuberculosis. Appeance is gaunt and withering, almost skeletal, left
    lung collapsed and right lung failing. Remains bedridden on life support.\r\n\r\nHistory:
    Patient brought in from the local factory after the severe industrial acident,
    leaving severeal others in our care aswell. Other than this, and the  knowledge
    of her husband and two children, her histoy remaines unobtained. spouse: unknown,
    next of kin: unknown.\r\n\r\n\r\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
